| # | Decision | Approved value |
|---|---|---|
| D1 | Input features | 15 per event, adding `repeated_failure` and `validation_comparable`. Input 120, 3,256 parameter slots. |
| D2 | Oracle thresholds | As in §6.2: `ε_p = 0.02`, `F_prod = 2`, `N_stall = 5`, `N_grey = 3`, `N_rev = 2`, `R_max = 3`, `P_max = 5`. Grey-zone and ambiguous windows are excluded from scoring, but predictions on them are reported. |
| D3 | Phase A variants | A-strict and A-selfcheck are both archived and reported. **A-selfcheck is the headline Phase A result**, and the §10.2 targets apply to it. |
